#: processes/ingest-l1-completeness-gate.bpmn:112
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Record the completeness verdict in three states — met, unmet, or not yet derivable — as bun run check:l1-complete reports it. Not-yet-derivable is never a pass. An unmet verdict opens a bean and returns to derivation; only a met one lets the entry into library/."
